---
import { ArrowUpRight } from "@lucide/astro";
import { packages } from "../data/packages";
---

<section id="ecosystem" class="home-ecosystem page-section" aria-labelledby="ecosystem-title">
  <div class="ecosystem-intro" data-reveal><span class="section-note">The ecosystem</span><h2 id="ecosystem-title">One model.<br />Your environment.</h2><p>Start with the core. Add the packages your application needs. Each integration shares the same model semantics.</p><a class="text-link" href="/project/architecture/">Explore the architecture <ArrowUpRight size={17} /></a><div class="ecosystem-threads" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div>
  <div class="package-list" data-reveal>{packages.map((entry) => <a class="package-row" href={entry.docs}><span class="package-name"><span>@queryweave/</span>{entry.name.replace("@queryweave/", "")}</span><span class="package-description">{entry.responsibility.replaceAll("`", "")}</span><ArrowUpRight size={18} aria-hidden="true" /></a>)}</div>
</section>
